  {
   "approach": "From the Pinkham Notch Visitor Center on Route 16, follow the Tuckerman Ravine Trail until the Huntington Ravine Fire Road branches right, then continue north past Harvard Cabin onto the floor of the ravine. The line sits directly right of Cloudwalker, before Mechanic's Route, low on the headwall beside Central Gully. Slopes above can slide, so check the avalanche forecast.",
