  {
   "approach": "From the Pinkham Notch Visitor Center on Route 16, follow the Tuckerman Ravine Trail until the Huntington Ravine Fire Road branches right, then continue north past Harvard Cabin onto the floor of the ravine. The gully lies just right of the Pinnacle Buttress and left of the gentle Central Gully. Most trouble on this route comes from the snow above the ice, so check the avalanche forecast before you go.",
   "area_id": "nh_huntington_ravine_winter_ice",
   "descent": null,
