  {
   "approach": "From the Pinkham Notch Visitor Center on Route 16, follow the Tuckerman Ravine Trail until the Huntington Ravine Fire Road branches right, then continue north past Harvard Cabin onto the floor of the ravine. The climb is the pillar beside the start of Cloudwalker, low in Central Gully; it hangs over parties starting Cloudwalker.",
   "area_id": "nh_huntington_ravine_winter_ice",
   "descent": null,
   "descent_text": "The usual way off is to walk down Central Gully. Take care, since slopes there can slide, and check the avalanche forecast.",
